        "original_id": "51f16c5a-793a-5621-aced-32e7177337c1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Grohl, Mark Monroe, King Buzzo, Osborne\n- Bands: Foo Fighters, Nirvana\n- Works: Sonic Highways, King Buzzo (album)\n- Topics: documentary miniseries, musical history of American cities\n\nFacts:\n- Sonic Highways is a 2014 American documentary miniseries directed by Dave Grohl and written by Mark Monroe.\n- Sonic Highways has eight episodes, and each episode explores the musical history of a different American city through interviews conducted by Dave Grohl.\n- Dave Grohl was the drummer of Nirvana.\n- Dave Grohl founded Foo Fighters and serves as its frontman, lead vocalist, rhythm and lead guitarist, and primary songwriter.\n- Osborne recruited Nirvana drummer Dave Grohl for the King Buzzo album project.",
